{"type":"Film","id":"FR2014_158","slug":"fr2014-158-asterix-le-domaine-des-dieux","title":{"native":"Astérix : Le domaine des dieux","english":"Asterix - The Mansion of the Gods"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2014-11-26","year":2014},"filmType":"Animation","directors":[{"id":"Alexandre Astier","slug":"alexandre-astier","name":"Alexandre Astier","birthYear":1974,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},{"id":"Louis Clichy","slug":"louis-clichy","name":"Louis Clichy","birthYear":1977,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Adventure"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/146/2/131730/format_page/asterix-le-domaine-des-dieux.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hGy72w2AIGU"},"synopsis":{"native":"Nous sommes en 50 avant Jésus-Christ , toute la Gaule est occupée par les Romains… Toute ? Non ! Car un village peuplé d'irréductibles Gaulois résiste encore et toujours à l'envahisseur. Exaspéré par la situation, Jules César décide de changer de tactique : puisque ses armées sont incapables de s’imposer par la force, c’est la civilisation romaine elle-même qui saura séduire ces barbares Gaulois. Il fait donc construire à côté du village un domaine résidentiel luxueux destiné à des propriétaires romains : « Le Domaine des Dieux ». Nos amis gaulois résisteront ils à l’appât du gai n et au confort romain ? Leur village deviendra-t-il une simple attraction touristique ? Astérix et Obélix vont tout faire pour contrecarrer les plans de César.","english":"Year 50 BC: all of Gaul is occupied by the Romans. All? Not quite! Because a village inhabited by unwavering Gauls is still resisting the invading hordes. Exasperated by the situation, Julius Cesar decides to change tactics: because his armies are incapable of imposing themselves by force, Roman civilization itself will seduce these barbarian Gauls. He hence orders luxurious residences, The Mansions of the Gods, destined for Roman families to be built next to he village. Will our Gaul friends resist the lure of gain and Roman comfort? Will their village become a simple tourist attraction? Asterix and Obelix will do everything in their power to thwart Cesar's plans."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Alain Chabat","slug":"alain-chabat","name":"Alain Chabat","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Voice actor"},{"person":{"id":"Alexandre Astier","slug":"alexandre-astier","name":"Alexandre Astier","birthYear":1974,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Bernard Alane","slug":"bernard-alane","name":"Bernard Alane","birthYear":1948,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Voice actor"},{"person":{"id":"Brigitte Lecordier","slug":"brigitte-lecordier","name":"Brigitte Lecordier","birthYear":1956,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Voice actor"},{"person":{"id":"Christian Peythieu","slug":"christian-peythieu","name":"Christian Peythieu","birthYear":1951,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Voice actor"},{"person":{"id":"Christophe Bourseiller","slug":"christophe-bourseiller","name":"Christophe Bourseiller","birthYear":1957,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Voice actor"},{"person":{"id":"François Morel","slug":"francois-morel","name":"François Morel","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Voice actor"},{"person":{"id":"Jean-Claude Donda","slug":"jean-claude-donda","name":"Jean-Claude Donda","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male i